sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent Orchestrator<br/>(Bedrock / planner)
    participant R as Retrieval plane<br/>(RAG — untrusted)
    participant G as Tool Gateway<br/>policy + RBAC
    participant S as Domain Service<br/>(deterministic API)
    participant H as Human approver<br/>(high-risk tier)

    U->>A: Goal / intent
    A->>R: Fetch context
    R-->>A: Documents (untrusted input)
    A->>G: ToolCall(refund, args, idempotency_key)
    G->>G: Risk tier check
    alt amount above threshold
        G->>H: Approval required
        H-->>G: Approved / denied
    end
    G->>S: execute(refund) — versioned API
    S-->>G: Receipt / domain event
    G-->>A: Observation (structured)
    A-->>U: Response + citations
